                <pb facs="0958" n="856" sameAs="frus:frus1919v01/pg856"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">818.00/846: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in
                        Honduras</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Jones</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-08-27T16:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">August 27,
                                1919, 4 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Your August 19, 6 P.M.</p>
                <p>Department cannot recognize Government of Quiros in Costa Rica, it being a
                    creature of Tinoco. Government must be formed in accord with old constitution
                    and free election must occur.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
